member.summary:
Operations of one wrapper instance run in call order, one at a time;
a synchronous member call on that instance is rejected while its
operations are pending.

The idempotent unsubscriber  returns.
Disposing detaches the bridge's delegate from the wrapper's CLR event;
a second disposal is a no-op.

